{"id":"d3b04e0df1122f31","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-effective-calculus.md","title":"Effective Calculi and Their Arithmetic Fragments","display":"df-effective-calculus — Effective Calculi and Their Arithmetic Fragments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-effective-calculus","aliases":["67-df-effective-calculus"],"display":"df-effective-calculus — Effective Calculi and Their Arithmetic Fragments","depends_on":["[[67-df-quantifier-language]]","[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","[[67-df-predicate-logic]]","[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[67-df-complete]]","[[67-df-sequence]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-effective-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-effective-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-calculus — Effective Calculi and Their Arithmetic Fragments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a548cb5c1ed94888\" href=\"?note=a548cb5c1ed94888\" title=\"67-df-quantifier-language\">67-df-quantifier-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b59d5ff6e43660a9\" href=\"?note=b59d5ff6e43660a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a1432082607876a\" href=\"?note=9a1432082607876a\" title=\"67-df-predicate-logic\">67-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d59b0b327715a4b0\" href=\"?note=d59b0b327715a4b0\" title=\"67-df-complete\">67-df-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)\">\\(\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a548cb5c1ed94888\" href=\"?note=a548cb5c1ed94888\" title=\"67-df-quantifier-language\">67-df-quantifier-language</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_\\Lambda\">\\(g_\\Lambda\\)</span> 为其固定有效单射编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>候选演算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 由关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda\">\\(D_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda\\)</span> 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathcal C}(F,\\theta)\">\\(D_{\\mathcal C}(F,\\theta)\\)</span> 表示允许有限前提 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的一次完整推导；不将其与广义量词的语义有效性等同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fcode}_\\Lambda(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{fcode}_\\Lambda(F)\\)</span> 是先按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_\\Lambda\">\\(g_\\Lambda\\)</span> 递增排列有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 再编码所得的数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"338538aaf52f60c4\" href=\"?note=338538aaf52f60c4\" title=\"67-df-sequence\">67-df-sequence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9a1432082607876a\" href=\"?note=9a1432082607876a\" title=\"67-df-predicate-logic\">67-df-predicate-logic</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=\\neg(0=0)\">\\(\\bot=\\neg(0=0)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式定义演算有效性、演算相对可证性、一致性和完全性，以及算术片段的闭包要求。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithExt}\\)</span> 是实质前提，不由量词的同构不变性推出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{fcode}_\\Lambda(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{enc}(\\iota\\vec a\\,[\\{a_i:i&lt;|\\vec a|\\}=g_\\Lambda[F]\\land\\forall i+1&lt;|\\vec a|\\ (a_i&lt;a_{i+1})]),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\{(\\operatorname{fcode}_\\Lambda(F),g_\\Lambda(\\theta)):D_{\\mathcal C}(F,\\theta)\\}\\in\\mathrm{REPred}_2,\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\theta&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\in[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ D_{\\mathcal C}(F,\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{REAx}_\\Lambda(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow g_\\Lambda[T]\\in\\mathrm{REPred}_1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\bot),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal C,\\Lambda}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda\\ (T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\theta\\lor T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\neg\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\subseteq\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\land\n\\forall F\\in[\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl(F\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{fcode}_\\Lambda(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{enc}(\\iota\\vec a\\,[\\{a_i:i&lt;|\\vec a|\\}=g_\\Lambda[F]\\land\\forall i+1&lt;|\\vec a|\\ (a_i&lt;a_{i+1})]),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\{(\\operatorname{fcode}_\\Lambda(F),g_\\Lambda(\\theta)):D_{\\mathcal C}(F,\\theta)\\}\\in\\mathrm{REPred}_2,\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\theta&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\in[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ D_{\\mathcal C}(F,\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{REAx}_\\Lambda(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow g_\\Lambda[T]\\in\\mathrm{REPred}_1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\bot),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal C,\\Lambda}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda\\ (T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\theta\\lor T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\neg\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\subseteq\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\land\n\\forall F\\in[\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl(F\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原三个量词不完备性条目把一阶的 REAx、Con、Complete 直接套用于扩展语言。本条显式区分语言与演算；只要求算术片段是有效、一致、含 Q 的经典演绎闭包，足以应用 Rosser 定理，不额外假定广义量词语义的可计算性。</p>\n","headings":