}\\theta\\lor T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\neg\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\subseteq\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\land\n\\forall F\\in[\\operatorname{ArTh}_{\\mathcal C}(T)]^{<\\omega}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl(F\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3066,"backlinks":[{"id":"7fdea8f95f2861a9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda$；$\\mathcal C$ 为 [[67-df-effective-calculus]] 的候选演算。所有可证性、REAx、一致性及完全性均使用该文件的带语言、演算下标接口。"},{"id":"589664f33390c7ce","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda$；$\\mathcal C$ 为 [[67-df-effective-calculus]] 的候选演算。所有可证性、REAx、一致性及完全性均使用该文件的带语言、演算下标接口。"},{"id":"0485e18b7419ccd1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda$；$\\mathcal C$ 为 [[67-df-effective-calculus]] 的候选演算。所有可证性、REAx、一致性及完全性均使用该文件的带语言、演算下标接口。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-effective-calculus]] — Effective Calculi and Their Arithmetic Fragments。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-effective-calculus]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-effective-calculus]]"}],"outgoing":["a548cb5c1ed94888","b59d5ff6e43660a9","9a1432082607876a","824fdc45d800b7dd","d59b0b327715a4b0","338538aaf52f60c4"]}